# NC Sound Lab is fully local-first.
#
# No API keys, no cloud services, no environment variables are required to
# run the app. All persistence (sound kits, projects, favorites) is handled
# in the browser via IndexedDB (Dexie). Cover art is generated deterministically
# from a seed, not via an external AI API.
#
# This file is kept only to satisfy the conventional `.env.example` placeholder.
# You do not need to copy it to `.env.local`.
